---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout container={true}>
    <h1>NOW</h1>

    <div class="now-flex-row">
        <div class="now-text-col">
            <p class="now-date">07.09.2026</p>
            <div class="now-details">
                <p>wow it's been a long time since i've done one of these, because life has been moving so fast! i graduated, moved to a new city, started a new job, and i'm figuring it all out again.</p>
                <p>in the bay area, i've loved having so many of my people at arms reach, exploring the printmaking scene, setting up a new apartment in lower haight with three friends, and all the things that you should do while listening to <a href="https://www.nts.live/shows/harriet-brown/episodes/harriet-brown-15th-may-2026">this</a>.</p>
                <blockquote>Downtempo and R&B for walking high in the golden hour sun, studying the city from a distance, and lightly reflecting on the evolution of all your various connections.</blockquote>
            
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="now-img-col">
        <img src="/dec.png" class="now-img" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="now-flex-row">
        <div class="now-text-col">
            <p class="now-date">04.01.2026</p>
            <div class="now-details">
                <p>happy new year!</p>
                <p>the murmuration of starlings in Rome was one of the most memorable natural phenomena i've gotten to witness. </p>
                <p>the birds focus on matching only a few of their neighbours, and end up forming these beautiful, scintillating, abstract shapes in the sky, without even knowing it.</p>
                <p>also i left all my work behind for the first time in a long time. and the food was realllyyyyy good!</p>
                <p>relevant to this site: i'm trying to write a post a week this year. if i'm silent for more than 2 weeks, yell at me!! </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="now-img-col">
            <img src="/dec.png" class="now-img" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="now-flex-row">
        <div class="now-text-col">
            <p class="now-date">03.11.2025</p>
            <div class="now-details">
                <p>back to cold, autumnal, academic Oxford: it's beautiful here :^)</p>
                <p>my favourite course right now is <a href="https://www.cs.ox.ac.uk/teaching/courses/2024-2025/co/">combinatorial optimisation</a>. i'm also doing a research project on models for hypothesis generation for genetic perturbation studies: post on this coming soon!</p>
                <p>focusing on writing (on here!) and making things (as opposed to running events and stuff. main hobbies are gym and lino as usual, but i'm also getting back into acoustic guitar, running, cooking more creatively.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="now-img-col">
            <img src="/nov-view.webp" class="now-img" />
            <img src="/nov-lino.webp" class="now-img" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- <h1>PREVIOUSLY</h1> -->
    <div class="now-flex-row">
        <div class="now-text-col">
            <p class="now-date">21.07.2025</p>
            <div class="now-details">
                <p>building <a href="https://granola.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">granola</a>, taking pottery classes, learning design, building up this site.</p>
                <p>spending summer in London with family and friends, enjoying routine.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="now-img-col">
            <img src="/compressed/DSCF6929.webp" class="now-img" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="now-flex-row">
        <div class="now-text-col">
            <p class="now-date">23.04.2025</p>
            <div class="now-details">
                <p>bringing maker/hackathon culture to Oxford, and the UK, by running weekly co-working sessions at <a href="https://orchard.day" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[orchard]</a> and by organising <a href="https://ensemble.rodeo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ensemble</a></p>
                <p>finishing my second year of university</p>
                <p>making a large multicolour lino print, thinking about mediums of sharing information for more efficient learning</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="now-img-col">
            <img src="/compressed/_DSC0355.webp" class="now-img" />
            <img src="/compressed/_DSC0902.webp" class="now-img" />
            
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .now-details p { text-align: left; }
    </style>
</BaseLayout>